"<div class=\"brand-bar\"><img src=\"%%A0%%\" alt=\"Sophia Deutsch Akademie\" class=\"brand-logo\"><div class=\"brand-name\">Sophia Deutsch Akademie</div></div>\n<header class=\"lk-hd\"><div class=\"lk-topic\"><svg class=\"ic\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 20l1-4.2L16.2 4.6a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 2.3 0l.9.9a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 0 2.3L8.2 19z\"/><path d=\"M14.5 6.4l3.1 3.1\"/></svg></div><div class=\"lk-kicker\">Übung</div><div class=\"lk-big\">06</div><h1>어순과 의문문</h1><div class=\"lk-de\">Wortstellung und Fragesätze</div><div class=\"lk-intro\">Lektion 06의 문법을 직접 풀어 보며 익혀요.<br>A1 수준의 문장으로, 기본 16 · 중간 8 · 도전 6 문제를 풀어요.<div class=\"x-goals\"><div class=\"x-goals-t\">이 연습에서 확인할 것</div><div class=\"x-goal\">활용된 동사를 두 번째 자리에 놓고, 첫 자리가 바뀌면 도치해요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">Ja/Nein 의문문과 W-의문문을 만들어요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">격과 뜻에 맞는 의문사를 골라요 — wer·wen·wem·wessen, wo·wohin·woher</div><div class=\"x-goal\">가운데 자리의 순서와 빈도 부사의 자리를 지켜요</div></div><div class=\"x-goals\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"x-goals-t\">풀이 방법</div><div class=\"x-goal\">보기를 고르거나, 빈칸에 쓰거나, 단어를 눌러 문장을 만들어요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">빈칸 옆 괄호와 한국어 뜻이 힌트예요. 대문자와 소문자는 구별하지 않아요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">단어 배열에는 문장부호가 없어요. 문법에 맞는 어순이면 모두 정답이에요</div></div></div></header>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge review-badge\">기본</span><span class=\"sub-title\">기본 문제 · 배운 내용을 그대로 확인해요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">1.</strong> '내일 우리는 수영해요.'</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Morgen schwimmt wir.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) Morgen schwimmen wir.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Morgen wir schwimmen.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Wir morgen schwimmen.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">Morgen이 첫 자리에 오면 동사가 두 번째, 주어 wir는 동사 바로 뒤로 가요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;koche&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">2.</strong> Heute Abend <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(kochen)</span> ich Suppe.</div><div class=\"qko\">오늘 저녁에 나는 수프를 끓여요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Heute Abend <b>koche</b> ich Suppe.</div>Heute Abend가 한 성분으로 첫 자리예요.<br>동사 koche가 두 번째, 주어 ich가 그 뒤에 와요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;Wo&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">3.</strong> <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"> wohnt Herr Becker? — In Hamburg.</div><div class=\"qko\">베커 씨는 어디 살아요? — 함부르크에서요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Wo</b> wohnt Herr Becker? — In Hamburg.</div>머무는 곳(wohnen)은 wo로 물어요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">4.</strong> <span class=\"qblank\"></span> fliegt ihr? — Nach Wien.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Woher</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Wann</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Wo</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) Wohin</button></div><div class=\"qe\">Nach Wien은 가는 곳이에요. 목적지는 wohin으로 물어요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">5.</strong> <span class=\"qblank\"></span> kommt Herr Novak? — Aus Prag.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) Woher</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Wo</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Wohin</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Wer</button></div><div class=\"qe\">Aus Prag는 온 곳이에요. 출신은 woher로 물어요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">6.</strong> <span class=\"qblank\"></span> fragst du? — Den Kellner.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Was</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Wer</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Wem</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) Wen</button></div><div class=\"qe\">fragen은 4격 동사예요. 사람을 4격으로 물을 때는 wen이에요(den Kellner와 끝이 같아요).</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;Wem&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">7.</strong> <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"> hilft Felix heute? — Der Nachbarin.</div><div class=\"qko\">펠릭스는 오늘 누구를 도와줘요? — 이웃 아주머니요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Wem</b> hilft Felix heute? — Der Nachbarin.</div>helfen은 3격 동사라서 의문사도 3격 wem이에요.<br>한국어 '누구를'에 끌려 wen을 쓰지 않아요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;Hast&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">8.</strong> <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(haben)</span> du ein Fahrrad?</div><div class=\"qko\">너 자전거 있어?</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Hast</b> du ein Fahrrad?</div>Ja/Nein 의문문은 동사가 맨 앞이에요. du → hast.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Spielt ihr heute Tennis&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">9.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">너희 오늘 테니스 쳐?</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">Tennis</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">heute</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">Spielt</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">ihr</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Spielt ihr heute Tennis?</b></div>Ja/Nein 의문문은 동사 + 주어 순서로 시작하고, 그다음에 시간·목적어가 와요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">10.</strong> '나는 가끔 그림을 그려요.'</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Ich manchmal male.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Male ich manchmal.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) Ich male manchmal.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Manchmal ich male.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">빈도 부사는 동사 뒤에 와요.<br>Manchmal을 앞에 두면 도치해서 Manchmal male ich.가 돼요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;isst&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">11.</strong> Was <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(essen)</span> du gern?</div><div class=\"qko\">너는 뭘 즐겨 먹어?</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Was <b>isst</b> du gern?</div>의문사 바로 뒤에 동사가 와요.<br>essen은 du에서 e → i, 어간이 -s로 끝나서 du isst예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;Wie viel&quot;,&quot;Wieviel&quot;],[&quot;Wie viele&quot;,&quot;Wieviele&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">12.</strong> <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:10ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"> Zucker nimmst du? · <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:11ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"> Eier brauchst du?</div><div class=\"qko\">설탕을 얼마나 넣어? · 달걀이 몇 개 필요해?</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Wie viel</b> Zucker nimmst du? · <b>Wie viele</b> Eier brauchst du?</div>셀 수 없는 Zucker는 wie viel, 셀 수 있는 복수 Eier는 wie viele로 물어요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;Wie&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">13.</strong> <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"> heißt der Hund?</div><div class=\"qko\">그 개는 이름이 뭐예요?</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Wie</b> heißt der Hund?</div>이름은 Wie heißt …?로 물어요. 한국어 '뭐'에 끌려 Was를 쓰지 않아요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">14.</strong> <span class=\"qblank\"></span> singt da? — Lena.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Was</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Wen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) Wer</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Wem</button></div><div class=\"qe\">노래하는 사람은 주어(1격)예요. 사람을 1격으로 물을 때는 wer예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Am Wochenende putzt Jonas das Bad&quot;,&quot;Jonas putzt am Wochenende das Bad&quot;,&quot;Das Bad putzt Jonas am Wochenende&quot;,&quot;Jonas putzt das Bad am Wochenende&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">15.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">주말에 요나스는 욕실을 청소해요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">Bad</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">Jonas</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">Am</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">putzt</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">Wochenende</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">das</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Am Wochenende putzt Jonas das Bad.</b></div>무엇이 첫 자리에 오든 동사 putzt는 두 번째예요.<br>Am Wochenende가 앞에 오면 주어 Jonas가 동사 뒤로 가요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;ist&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">16.</strong> Warum <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(sein)</span> Lisa heute so müde?</div><div class=\"qko\">리자는 오늘 왜 이렇게 피곤해요?</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Warum <b>ist</b> Lisa heute so müde?</div>의문사 warum 바로 뒤에 동사가 와요. Lisa → ist.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">중간</span><span class=\"sub-title\">중간 문제 · 조건이 한두 개 더 붙어요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">17.</strong> '나는 그것을 그에게 팔아요.' (das Fahrrad → es)</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Ich verkaufe ihn es.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) Ich verkaufe es ihm.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Ich verkaufe ihm es.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Ich verkaufe es ihn.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">대명사끼리는 4격(es)이 먼저, 3격(ihm)이 뒤예요.<br>받는 사람은 3격이라서 ihn이 아니라 ihm이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Tim geht morgens allein ins Fitnessstudio&quot;,&quot;Morgens geht Tim allein ins Fitnessstudio&quot;,&quot;Allein geht Tim morgens ins Fitnessstudio&quot;,&quot;Tim geht allein morgens ins Fitnessstudio&quot;,&quot;Ins Fitnessstudio geht Tim morgens allein&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">18.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">팀은 아침마다 혼자 헬스장에 가요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">Tim</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">geht</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">Fitnessstudio</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">allein</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">morgens</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">ins</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Tim geht morgens allein ins Fitnessstudio.</b></div>가운데 자리는 시간(morgens) → 방법(allein) → 장소(ins Fitnessstudio) 순서예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;fährt&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">19.</strong> Im Urlaub <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(fahren)</span> Herr Weber oft nach Spanien.</div><div class=\"qko\">휴가 때 베버 씨는 자주 스페인에 가요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Im Urlaub <b>fährt</b> Herr Weber oft nach Spanien.</div>Im Urlaub가 첫 자리라서 동사가 두 번째, 주어는 그 뒤예요.<br>fahren은 er에서 a → ä로 바뀌어요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">20.</strong> <span class=\"qblank\"></span> gefällt der Film? — Mir.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) Wem</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Was</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Wer</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Wen</button></div><div class=\"qe\">gefallen은 3격 동사예요. 마음에 들어 하는 사람이 3격(mir)이라서 wem으로 물어요.<br>주어는 der Film이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;Wohin&quot;],[&quot;fahrt&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">21.</strong> <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"> <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(fahren)</span> ihr am Wochenende? — Nach Leipzig.</div><div class=\"qko\">너희 주말에 어디 가? — 라이프치히로.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Wohin</b> <b>fahrt</b> ihr am Wochenende? — Nach Leipzig.</div>목적지는 wohin, 그 바로 뒤에 동사가 와요.<br>ihr는 모음이 바뀌지 않아서 fahrt예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">22.</strong> '나는 그녀를 자주 찾아가요.'</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Ich besuche oft sie.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Oft ich besuche sie.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Ich oft besuche sie.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) Ich besuche sie oft.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">대명사 목적어가 있으면 빈도 부사는 대명사 뒤에 와요.<br>동사는 언제나 두 번째 자리예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;Wessen&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">23.</strong> <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(주인을 물어요)</span> Schlüssel liegt hier?</div><div class=\"qko\">여기 있는 건 누구 열쇠예요?</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Wessen</b> Schlüssel liegt hier?</div>'누구의'는 2격 의문사 wessen이에요. 뒤에 명사가 바로 와요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Wie schmeckt dir die Suppe&quot;,&quot;Wie schmeckt die Suppe dir&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">24.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">수프 맛이 어때?</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">Suppe</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">die</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">dir</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">Wie</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">schmeckt</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Wie schmeckt dir die Suppe?</b></div>의문사 wie 바로 뒤에 동사가 와요.<br>대명사 dir가 명사 주어 die Suppe보다 앞에 와요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">도전</span><span class=\"sub-title\">도전 문제 · 함정과 예외까지 따져 봐요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">25.</strong> 틀린 문장은?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) Wem fragt Lea im Kurs?</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Wohin fährt der Bus jetzt?</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Welche Zeitung kauft Herr Wolf?</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Am Abend liest er oft Comics.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">fragen은 4격 동사라서 Wen fragt Lea im Kurs?가 맞아요.<br>나머지는 도치, 모음 변화(liest·fährt), welch-가 모두 맞아요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;Wohin&quot;],[&quot;Wo&quot;],[&quot;Wem&quot;],[&quot;Was für ein&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">26.</strong> A: <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"> fahrt ihr heute? — B: Zu Jana.<br>A: <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"> wohnt Jana? — B: In Bonn.<br>A: <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 3\"> schenkt ihr das Buch? — B: Jana!<br>A: Und <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:13ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 4\"><span class=\"qh\">(종류를 물어요)</span> Buch ist das? — B: Ein Krimi.</div><div class=\"qko\">너희 오늘 어디 가? — 야나한테. / 야나는 어디 살아? — 본에. / 그 책은 누구한테 선물해? — 야나한테! / 그런데 그건 어떤 책이야? — 추리 소설.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · A: <b>Wohin</b> fahrt ihr heute? — B: Zu Jana.<br>A: <b>Wo</b> wohnt Jana? — B: In Bonn.<br>A: <b>Wem</b> schenkt ihr das Buch? — B: Jana!<br>A: Und <b>Was für ein</b> Buch ist das? — B: Ein Krimi.</div>가는 곳은 wohin, 사는 곳은 wo예요.<br>schenken의 받는 사람은 3격이라서 wem, 책의 종류는 was für ein으로 물어요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Ich erkläre es ihm morgen im Büro&quot;,&quot;Morgen erkläre ich es ihm im Büro&quot;,&quot;Im Büro erkläre ich es ihm morgen&quot;,&quot;Morgen im Büro erkläre ich es ihm&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">27.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">나는 내일 사무실에서 그에게 그것을 설명해요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">Ich</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">im</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">Büro</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">morgen</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">ihm</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">erkläre</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">es</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Ich erkläre es ihm morgen im Büro.</b></div>대명사가 먼저 오고, 대명사끼리는 4격(es) → 3격(ihm)이에요.<br>그다음 시간(morgen) → 장소(im Büro) 순서예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">28.</strong> Paul gibt der Katze morgens immer Milch.<br>이 문장을 Morgens로 시작하면?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Morgens Paul gibt der Katze immer Milch.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Morgens immer gibt Paul der Katze Milch.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Morgens gibt Paul immer Milch der Katze.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) Morgens gibt Paul der Katze immer Milch.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">Morgens가 첫 자리 → 동사 gibt → 주어 Paul이에요.<br>명사 목적어는 3격(der Katze) → 4격(Milch), 빈도 부사 immer는 명사 목적어 Milch 앞이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">29.</strong> Wem gehört die Brille? — 알맞은 대답은?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Er gehört dem Koch.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Sie gehört den Koch.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Es gehört der Koch.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) Sie gehört dem Koch.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">die Brille는 여성이라서 대명사 sie로 받아요.<br>gehören은 3격 동사라서 주인은 dem Koch예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;Wem&quot;],[&quot;gibst&quot;],[&quot;Wen&quot;],[&quot;triffst&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">30.</strong> <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"> <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(geben)</span> du den Kuchen? — Der Nachbarin.<br><input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 3\"> <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:9ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 4\"><span class=\"qh\">(treffen)</span> du morgen? — Den Trainer.</div><div class=\"qko\">그 케이크를 누구에게 줘? — 이웃 아주머니에게. / 내일 누구를 만나? — 그 코치를.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Wem</b> <b>gibst</b> du den Kuchen? — Der Nachbarin.<br><b>Wen</b> <b>triffst</b> du morgen? — Den Trainer.</div>대답 der Nachbarin이 3격이라서 wem, den Trainer가 4격이라서 wen이에요.<br>의문사 바로 뒤에 동사가 오고, geben·treffen은 du에서 e → i로 바뀌어요 — gibst · triffst.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"qscore\" data-total=\"30\" data-no-print><div class=\"qscore-t\">맞힌 문제 <b class=\"qscore-n\">0</b> / 30</div><div class=\"qscore-bar\"><i></i></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"all\">모두 다시 풀기</button></div>\n<div class=\"brand-foot\"><img src=\"%%A0%%\" alt=\"Sophia Deutsch Akademie\" class=\"foot-logo\"><div class=\"foot-name\">Sophia Deutsch Akademie</div><div class=\"foot-tag\">Innovative Learning Beyond the Traditional</div></div>"